---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 | ORhythm"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。"
>
  <div class="min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-md space-y-6">
      
      <!-- 404 徽标 -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 rounded-3xl bg-[#0f1629] border border-[#4fd6ff]/30 text-[#4fd6ff] shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(79,214,255,0.2)]">
        <span class="text-3xl font-black font-mono">404</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
          页面似乎偏离了轨道
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          您所请求的页面地址不存在，可能已被移动或链接有误。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#4fd6ff] text-[#070b16] font-bold text-xs shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(79,214,255,0.3)] hover:bg-[#6be0ff] transition-all"
        >
          返回首页
        </a>
        <a
          href="/download"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#1a1b1c] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 text-white font-medium text-xs transition-all"
        >
          下载安装包
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
